{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾參加2014年香港小姐競選的黃碧蓮（Linna），去年9月與丈夫Jack遠赴印尼峇里島舉行浪漫婚禮，正式結為夫婦。</p><p>上月25日，黃碧蓮再迎人生重要里程碑，宣布順利誕下愛子，正式升呢為人母。</p><p>昨天（21日），她在社交平台分享初生兒子的萌照及溫馨的一家三口全家福，洋溢初為父母的喜悅。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:01:06.483191+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:32:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632445+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:57:44.518881+00:00","content_hash":"24319e4654b4f385e20a9520d88e58612f1641dddd99f81443f461881f5bcd40","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}